{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L962","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:962"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration for the lazy-tool discovery catalog, shared by chat() and\nCode Mode. Optional in both — lazy behavior is triggered purely by tools\nmarked "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lazy: true"},{"type":"text","value":"; this only tunes how much of each lazy tool's\ndescription appears in the pre-discovery catalog. The post-discovery payload\nalways returns the full description + schema."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"includedescription","children":[{"type":"text","value":"includeDescription?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional includeDescription?: \"full\" | \"first-sentence\" | \"none\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L968","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:968"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"How much of each lazy tool's description appears in the pre-discovery\ncatalog (the names list shown before the model discovers the tool)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"default","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default"}]},{"type":"code","value":"'none'","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"includedescription","text":"includeDescription?","level":3},{"id":"default","text":"Default","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:962](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L962)\n\nConfiguration for the lazy-tool discovery catalog, shared by chat() and\nCode Mode. Optional in both — lazy behavior is triggered purely by tools\nmarked `lazy: true`; this only tunes how much of each lazy tool's\ndescription appears in the pre-discovery catalog. The post-discovery payload\nalways returns the full description + schema.\n\n## Properties\n\n### includeDescription?\n\n```ts\noptional includeDescription?: \"full\" | \"first-sentence\" | \"none\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:968](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L968)\n\nHow much of each lazy tool's description appears in the pre-discovery\ncatalog (the names list shown before the model discovers the tool).\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\n'none'\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: LazyToolsConfig\ntitle: LazyToolsConfig\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:962](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L962)\n\nConfiguration for the lazy-tool discovery catalog, shared by chat() and\nCode Mode. Optional in both — lazy behavior is triggered purely by tools\nmarked `lazy: true`; this only tunes how much of each lazy tool's\ndescription appears in the pre-discovery catalog. The post-discovery payload\nalways returns the full description + schema.\n\n## Properties\n\n### includeDescription?\n\n```ts\noptional includeDescription?: \"full\" | \"first-sentence\" | \"none\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:968](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L968)\n\nHow much of each lazy tool's description appears in the pre-discovery\ncatalog (the names list shown before the model discovers the tool).\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\n'none'\n```\n"}
